<p data-start=3D"307" data-end=3D"323">Try this safely:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"325" data-end=3D"542">
<li data-start=3D"325" data-end=3D"377" data-section-id=3D"gi6hfn">
<p data-start=3D"328" data-end=3D"377">Turn the machine off using the main =
