</li>
<li data-start=3D"378" data-end=3D"424" data-section-id=3D"bqzy5v">
<p data-start=3D"381" data-end=3D"424">Disconnect it from power for 10=E2=
=80=9315 minutes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"425" data-end=3D"522" data-section-id=3D"1wvmgjn">
<p data-start=3D"428" data-end=3D"522">Connect it directly to a stable wall=
 outlet=E2=80=94not an extension cable or weak voltage stabilizer.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"523" data-end=3D"542" data-section-id=3D"r7idx3">
<p data-start=3D"526" data-end=3D"542">Turn it on once.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"544" data-end=3D"599">If E0002 returns, stop using it. Lik=
