<li data-start=3D"641" data-end=3D"662" data-section-id=3D"1km82r7">
<p data-start=3D"643" data-end=3D"662">Failed fuser heater</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"663" data-end=3D"684" data-section-id=3D"sw6n5q">
<p data-start=3D"665" data-end=3D"684">Damaged fixing film</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"685" data-end=3D"715" data-section-id=3D"pm1xsu">
<p data-start=3D"687" data-end=3D"715">Loose or burned fuser wiring</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"716" data-end=3D"751" data-section-id=3D"1rochnh">
<p data-start=3D"718" data-end=3D"751">Defective thermal fuse/thermostat</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"752" data-end=3D"806" data-section-id=3D"1a81aov">
<p data-start=3D"754" data-end=3D"806">Less commonly, power-supply or DC-co=
ntroller failure</p>
</li>
</ul>
